After all, I wrote test for file_get_contents/file_put_contents:

/console/controllers/TestController.php:

```
<?php

namespace console\controllers;

use yii\console\Controller;

class TestController extends Controller
{
    public function actionFileGetContents()
    {
        $bigArray = [];
        for ($i = 0; $i != 50000; ++$i) {
            $bigArray[$i] = [
                'index' => $i,
                'value' => 'SomeText',
                'hash' => md5('SomeText')
            ];
        }

        $data = serialize($bigArray);

        file_put_contents("tmp.txt", $data, LOCK_EX);
        $data = file_get_contents("tmp.txt");
        $result = unserialize($data);
    }
}
```

And ran it in parallel:

```
seq 1 32 | xargs -L1 -P8 ./yii test/file-get-contents
Error: unserialize(): Error at offset 1540092 of 1540096 bytes
Error: unserialize(): Error at offset 2007038 of 2007040 bytes
Error: unserialize(): Error at offset 942074 of 942080 bytes
Error: unserialize(): Error at offset 2981886 of 2981888 bytes
Error: unserialize(): Error at offset 4325366 of 4325376 bytes
Error: unserialize(): Error at offset 131068 of 131072 bytes
```

So, problem described in 

> http://stackoverflow.com/a/4899822/209566

is really causes the bug in this issue.
